<title>HONG KONG: Tsim Sha Tsui 1995/96 net HK$595.75 mln.</title>
<headline>Tsim Sha Tsui 1995/96 net HK$595.75 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   47.7     vs 139.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    12.0     vs 8.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs 2,028.26 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    595.75   vs 1,693.15</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,630.94 vs 1,809.77</p>
<p>    Company name		 Tsim Sha Tsui Properties Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  November 18-22</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   December 23</p>
<p>NOTE - Tsim Sha Tsui Properties has interests in property development, hotels and restaurants.</p>
<p>Net is after exceptional items of nil vs HK$2.03 billion gain on disposal of the group's hospitality interests after spinning-off the related businesses.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 20 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of eight cents) vs 16 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
